[statement]
A requirement stating a version is not met by a package providing the name
at no version, though that package is installed for another: `a` needs
`p1`, which provides `x` at no version, and `b`, which requires `x=1.0`;
apk refuses. Contrast `providers/a-requirement-binds-a-provider-at-no-version`,
where the request states the version.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:b p1

P:p1
V:1
p:x
k:5

P:b
V:1
D:x=1.0

[request]
a

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   p1-1:
|     breaks: b-1[x=1.0]
|     satisfies: a-1[p1]
refused
